Conjure a surge of celestial power through your circles. Any foe standing within one of your circles will be slowed by 50% for [1, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns and take [43, 58, 70, 80, 89 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light and [43, 58, 70, 80, 89 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage.

Residual power from the surge will emanate from your circles for [2, 5, 6, 8, 8 (TL1-5)] turns; each circle you stand in will increase your celestial resources.

Shifting Shadows: +1 negative.

Sanctity: +1 postive.

Warding: +0.5 postive and negative.
